---
import Head from '../../components/Head.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import FlowDiagram from '../../components/FlowDiagram.astro';
import { platformFlow } from '../../data/site';
import '../../styles/global.css';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <Head
      title="35% faster pipelines. ~20% lower compute cost. — Aakash Patel"
      description="How a production data platform on Microsoft Fabric and Databricks got 35% faster with ~20% lower compute cost — same datasets, same reliability."
      path="/work/data-platform"
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <Header base="/" />

    <main id="main">
      <article>
        <div class="wrap work-hero">
          <p class="kicker"><span class="n">01</span> · Case study · Data Platform</p>
          <h1>35% faster pipelines. ~20% lower compute cost.</h1>
          <p class="work-lede">A production data platform running across Microsoft Fabric and Databricks, serving finance and operational workloads. Over time it had accumulated orchestration and compute overhead — slow to run, expensive to keep running, still responsible for the same datasets on the same schedule.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="grid12 metric-callouts" style="margin-bottom: 2rem">
            <div><p class="metric-num">35%</p><p class="metric-label">faster pipeline execution</p></div>
            <div><p class="metric-num">~20%</p><p class="metric-label">lower compute cost</p></div>
            <div><p class="metric-num">50+</p><p class="metric-label">stakeholders served</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section class="work-section" aria-label="Context and constraint">
          <div class="wrap grid12">
            <div class="work-body" style="grid-column: 1 / span 5">
              <h2>Context</h2>
              <p>The platform grew organically. Pipelines, schedules, and compute choices piled up over time. Sources included ERP, leasing, and finance systems; downstream, 50+ stakeholders depended on the datasets for daily decisions.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="work-body" style="grid-column: 7 / span 6">
              <h2>Constraint</h2>
              <p>Runtime and cost had to come down without touching reliability. Same datasets, same schedule, same guarantees — less waiting, less spend.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="work-section" aria-label="Architecture">
          <div class="wrap grid12">
            <div class="work-diagram">
              <h2>Architecture</h2>
              <FlowDiagram items={platformFlow} label="Data platform — simplified architecture" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="work-section" aria-label="Decision and result">
          <div class="wrap grid12">
            <div class="work-body">
              <h2>Decision</h2>
              <p>Orchestration was redesigned and compute simplified: fewer moving parts, less redundant processing, workloads sized and scheduled for what they actually needed. Nothing exotic — mostly removing work the system didn't need to do.</p>
              <h2 style="margin-top: 2.5rem">Result</h2>
              <p>Pipeline runtime down 35%. Compute cost down ~20%. Same datasets, same reliability, a third less waiting.</p>
            </div>
            <aside class="sidenote">
              <p>Overhead accumulates silently on platforms that work. Nobody schedules it; it just compounds.</p>
            </aside>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="work-section" aria-label="Pull quote">
          <div class="wrap grid12">
            <blockquote class="pullquote">Nothing exotic — mostly removing work the system didn't need to do.</blockquote>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="work-section" aria-label="Lessons">
          <div class="wrap grid12">
            <div style="grid-column: 1 / span 7">
              <h2>Lessons</h2>
              <ol class="lessons">
                <li>Overhead accumulates silently on platforms that work. Nobody schedules it; it just compounds.</li>
                <li>Removing unnecessary work beats optimizing necessary work.</li>
                <li>Cost and runtime are engineering constraints, not finance's problem to discover later.</li>
              </ol>
              <h2 style="margin-top: 2.5rem">Stack</h2>
              <p class="stack-line">Microsoft Fabric · Databricks · Spark</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="wrap">
          <nav class="work-nav" aria-label="More case studies">
            <a class="tlink" href="/"><span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">←</span>&nbsp;All work</a>
            <a class="tlink" href="/work/enterprise-ai">Next: Production AI <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </article>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
